      "reason": "Remove only explicitly retired configuration metadata and node admission flags with bounded row-count guards; add nullable folder-deletion provenance without guessing history; disable the single bootstrap maintenance-check-v1 placeholder schedule while retaining its history and all other schedules. The Bearer cache migration adds commit-time invalidation notifications without a data backfill. No business-content backfill or physical foreign keys. Existing search functionality is retained as technical implementation; its product behavior is not finalized. This candidate is incompatible with old writers and old API consumers: stop/drain old roles before migration through a separately reviewed maintenance release. No shared or target database has been modified."
